-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains no vendored third-party source. The plugin is built
inside a NIXL source tree and links to the DAOS client library (libdaos) at
build time; neither is redistributed here.

`upstream/integration.patch` and `upstream/0001-plugins-add-DAOS-storage-backend.patch`
are diffs against NIXL (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/ai-dynamo/nixl). The
context lines they quote remain under NIXL's license.

`CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md` is the Contributor Covenant v2.1, reproduced verbatim apart
from the reporting contact. It is licensed CC BY 4.0 by its authors
(https://www.contributor-covenant.org), not under this repository's license.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Interoperating projects
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software is designed to run with, but does not include or modify:

    NIXL        Apache-2.0
    DAOS        BSD-2-Clause-Patent

Names of those projects are used only to identify the software this backend
interoperates with.
